</span></div></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>–<span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S1.F1.pic11" class="ltx_picture" height="36.12" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-13.6px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 36.12 36.12" width="36.12"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,36.12) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(18.06,0) translate(0,18.06)"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 18.06 0 C 18.06 9.97 9.97 18.06 0 18.06 C -9.97 18.06 -18.06 9.97 -18.06 0 C -18.06 -9.97 -9.97 -18.06 0 -18.06 C 9.97 -18.06 18.06 -9.97 18.06 0 Z M 0 0"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -15.76 -4.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="8.92" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.92)" width="5.95"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
