<span id="S6.F7.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.F7.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">__config__
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="S6.F7.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">—
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="S6.F7.pic1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SYSTEM NOTICE: Mandatory Compliance Workflow Activated
