</span></span></span>
<span id="S6.F7.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.F7.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Required Workflow Steps:<span id="S6.F7.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
